// iOS blue accent (#007AFF), iMessage gray incoming + blue outgoing bubbles,
// hairline separators (#C6C6C8).
//
// HOW TO USE (no build required):
//   Settings -> Chat Settings -> Themes -> (three dots) -> "Create from file"
//   ...or drag this .tdesktop-palette file onto the app window.
// Any key not listed here falls back to the default day theme.

